{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Drylands is a car-combat RPG set in an ever-changing world that changes every run as an ancient power shifts the sands revealing previously uncovered secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like the world, enemies are also procedurally generated! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827720/extras/d4a50168a1f550cad1c6c3d8cef20d54.poster.avif?t=1761609396\" width=442 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827720/extras/d4a50168a1f550cad1c6c3d8cef20d54.webm?t=1761609396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827720/extras/d4a50168a1f550cad1c6c3d8cef20d54.mp4?t=1761609396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced\u00a0</strong>thrilling vehicular combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse procedurally generated</strong> locations make every run different  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>customizable car</strong> that can be changed to suit your playstyle  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A party-based RPG mechanic in which <strong>party member positioning</strong> will influence their role in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable party members</strong> that if added to your party will shift the gameplay in new ways</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2827720?t=1761609396","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827720/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761609396","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it